    <title>Grilled merguez sandwiches with caramelized onions, manchego, and harissa mayonnaise</title>
    <updated>2026-08-23T07:40:22.002101+00:00</updated>
    <content type="html">&lt;h1 style="text-align:center;font-family:sans-serif;"&gt;Grilled merguez sandwiches with caramelized onions, manchego, and harissa mayonnaise&lt;/h1&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;img src="https://www.strangerfoods.org/images/grilled-merguez-sandwiches-with-caramelized-onions-manchego-and-harissa-mayonnaise.webp" style="text-align:center;"/&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;p style="font-family:sans-serif;&gt;Grilled merguez on a toasted baguette with sweet caramelized onion, sharp Manchego cheese, fresh cilantro, and spicy harissa mayo makes for one insanely awesome sandwich. &lt;/p&gt;</content>
